+config ZRAM_MULTI_COMP
+	bool "Enable multiple compression streams"
+	depends on ZRAM
+	help
+	  This will enable multiple compression streams, so that ZRAM can
+	  re-compress pages using a potentially slower but more effective
+	  compression algorithm.  Idle page recompression uses the IDLE
+	  page flag (see /sys/block/zramX/idle).
